{"id": "3263940", "name": "שני ישרים נחתכים במרחב - נקודת חיתוך, זווית וישר ניצב", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: right;\">נתונים שני הישרים</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2; white-space: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; padding: 4px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ell_1: \\begin{cases} x={{CT:0}}\\\\ y={{CT:1}}\\\\ z={{CT:2}} \\end{cases} \\qquad \\ell_2: \\begin{cases} x={{CT:3}}\\\\ y={{CT:4}}\\\\ z={{CT:5}} \\end{cases} \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #ffffff; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נקודת החיתוך</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0; text-align: right;\">הוכיחו כי הישרים נחתכים ומצאו את נקודת החיתוך שלהם.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 6px; white-space: nowrap; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 10px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(P=\\)( [[input:ans1]], [[input:ans2]], [[input:ans3]])</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 10px;\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #ffffff; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">הזווית בין הישרים</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0; text-align: right;\">מצאו את הזווית החדה בין הישרים, ברדיאנים. ניתן להזין תשובה מדויקת באמצעות <span dir=\"ltr\">acos</span> או קירוב עשרוני.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 10px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\theta=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 10px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #ffffff; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ג</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">ישר הניצב לשני הישרים</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0; text-align: right;\">מצאו הצגה פרמטרית של הישר הניצב ל־\\(\\ell_1\\) ול־\\(\\ell_2\\) ועובר דרך נקודת החיתוך שלהם. ניתן לבחור כל נקודה על הישר וכל וקטור כיוון לא־אפס המקביל לו.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 6px; white-space: nowrap; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 10px; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\((x,y,z)=\\)( [[input:ans5]], [[input:ans6]], [[input:ans7]]) \\(+t\\)( [[input:ans8]], [[input:ans9]], [[input:ans10]])</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 10px;\">[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]] [[validation:ans7]] [[validation:ans8]] [[validation:ans9]] [[validation:ans10]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75;\">\n<p><strong>פתרון מלא</strong></p>\n<p>וקטורי הכיוון של שני הישרים הם</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ u=(1,{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}}),\\qquad v=(1,-({{CT:6}}),{{CT:8}}) \\]</div>\n<p>אם מציבים \\(t={{CT:9}}\\) ב־\\(\\ell_1\\) ו־\\(k={{CT:10}}\\) ב־\\(\\ell_2\\), בשני המקרים מתקבלת הנקודה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ P=({{CT:11}},{{CT:12}},{{CT:13}}) \\]</div>\n<p>ולכן הישרים אכן נחתכים, וזוהי נקודת החיתוך.</p>\n<p>לזווית החדה \\(\\theta\\) בין הישרים מתקיים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ \\cos\\theta= \\frac{|u\\cdot v|}{\\|u\\|\\|v\\|} = \\frac{|{{CT:14}}|} {\\sqrt{{{CT:15}}}\\sqrt{{{CT:16}}}} \\]</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ \\theta= \\operatorname{acos} \\left( \\frac{|{{CT:14}}|} {\\sqrt{{{CT:15}}}\\sqrt{{{CT:16}}}} \\right) \\]</div>\n<p>וקטור כיוון של ישר הניצב לשני הישרים מתקבל מן המכפלה הווקטורית</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ u\\times v= ({{CT:17}},{{CT:18}},{{CT:19}}) \\]</div>\n<p>ולכן אפשר לבחור את ההצגה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ (x,y,z)= ({{CT:11}},{{CT:12}},{{CT:13}}) +s({{CT:17}},{{CT:18}},{{CT:19}}) \\]</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt6]] [[feedback:prt7]] [[feedback:prt8]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans10", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans7", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 4, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans8", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans9", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "okx:is(ans1=rxx);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "okx", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">רכיב ה־<span dir=\"ltr\">x</span> של נקודת החי